			<div class="content" id="post-content-3918913">
									

<p>A goofy idea I came up with a while back, after I saw a meme that said something along the lines of &quot;if we found aliens, what would we do? Leave them alone, help them prosper, nuke them, or make sure their forklift operators are following OSHA regulations?&quot;</p>
<p>Thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gabriel-jade" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(414239); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=414239&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1542082658" alt="Gabriel Jade" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=414239)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gabriel-jade" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(414239); return false;">Gabriel Jade</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sir-baubius" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2200357); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2200357&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1542082658" alt="Sir Baubius" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2200357)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sir-baubius" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2200357); return false;">Sir Baubius</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/prototype-toaster" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3512728); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3512728&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1542082658" alt="Prototype_Toaster" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3512728)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/prototype-toaster" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3512728); return false;">Prototype_Toaster</a></span> for critique. Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2303803); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2303803&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1542082658" alt="Cyantreuse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php