<p>Edit: for the record, both images are by me</p>
<p>Edit: I'd like to bring attention to a <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4048">Chinese translation</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ashausesall" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1546989); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1546989&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1542082658" alt="ashausesall" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1546989)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ashausesall" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1546989); return false;">ashausesall</a></span></p>
<p>Edit: I'd also like to bring attention to a <a href="http://ja.scp-wiki.net/scp-4048">Japanese translation</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hasuma-s" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2767088); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2767088&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1542082658" alt="Hasuma_S" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2767088)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hasuma-s" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2767088); return false;">Hasuma_S</a></span></p>

